    <preface>
      <p>Trade Legislation Amendment Act (No. 1) 2016</p>
      <p>No. 31, 2016</p>
      <p>An Act to amend legislation relating to export and trade, and for other purposes</p>
      <p>Contents</p>
      <p>1	Short title	1</p>
      <p>2	Commencement	2</p>
      <p>3	Schedules	2</p>
      <p>Schedule 1—Export Market Development Grants	3</p>
