              <num>3</num>
              <heading>Subsection 33(2) (table item 6, column 2)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>After “material”, insert “(whether the literature or material is in electronic form or any other form)”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-4">
              <num>4</num>
