                  <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-8__qstr-1__sec-57C__para-a">
                    <num>a</num>
                    <content>
                      <p>the activity may have had, or the activity involved a thing that may have had, a detrimental impact on Australia’s trade reputation; or</p>
