              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-12__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <section eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-12__qstr-1__sec-105">
                  <num>105</num>
                  <heading>Administration costs</heading>
                  <subsection eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-12__qstr-1__sec-105__subsec-1">
                    <num>1</num>
                    <content>
                      <p>	(1)	In any financial year, no more than 5% of the money appropriated (the <b><i>appropriated amount</i></b>) by the Parliament for the purposes of making payments under this Act is to be applied in payment of the costs of the administration of this Act.</p>
                    </content>
                  </subsection>
                  <subsection eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-12__qstr-1__sec-105__subsec-2">
                    <num>2</num>
                    <content>
                      <p>To avoid doubt, if the costs of the administration of this Act for a financial year exceed 5% of the appropriated amount for that year, the excess costs are to be paid otherwise than out of the appropriated amount.</p>
                    </content>
                  </subsection>
                </section>
              </quotedStructure>
