                  <num>1A</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>The first review must be completed, and a written report given to the Minister, by a date determined by the Minister that is not later than <date date="2021-12-31">31 December 2021</date>.</p>
                  </content>
                </subsection>
                <subsection eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-13__qstr-1__subsec-1B">
                  <num>1B</num>
